{
  "bookId": "activity-snippets-huadengrole",
  "id": "section-25740",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25740001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "美人的心意",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "这里就是制作花灯的房间吗？有些装饰让我想起了「七星客栈」，你的品味很不错呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25740004",
              "text": "你喜欢就好。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25740003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "虽然我的年龄不大，可是却早已阅人无数。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "你这种人呢，在我的眼里单纯得就像是一张没有经过任何涂写的白纸一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25740007",
              "text": "这是什么意思？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25740006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "别想那么多，就当作这是一种对你的赞扬吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "毕竟我只有在你这样单纯的人面前，才能卸下所有的防备，尽情地享受当下本身带来的快乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25740009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "所以，你为我准备的这些，我会好好使用的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
